How to create freia-olog certificate:

Run the following command in src/main/resources/keystore directory:

openssl pkcs12 -export -out freia-olog.p12 -inkey ~/freia-olog-cerificates/server.key -in ~/freia-olog-cerificates/freia-olog_physics_uu_se_cert.cer -certfile ~/freia-olog-cerificates/freia-olog_physics_uu_se_interm.cer 

where:
~/freia-olog-cerificates/server.key				- private key created when creating certificate request file *crt sent to CA
~/freia-olog-cerificates/freia-olog_physics_uu_se_cert.cer	- Certificate only, PEM encoded received from CA
~/freia-olog-cerificates/freia-olog_physics_uu_se_interm.cer	- Root/Intermediate(s) only, PEM encoded received from CA

The new certificate received from ITS (Cert.pem) was used to create freia-olog.p12 (pw: password):

openssl pkcs12 -export -in Cert.pem -inkey server.key -out freia-olog.p12 -name cf                            
